# Normalize every text file to LF in the working tree.
# The test suite compares exact byte contents and embedded template literals,
# and CI runs on Linux only, so a CRLF checkout on Windows produces false
# failures (line-ending sensitive assertions and untranslated multi-line
# prompts). `eol=lf` overrides core.autocrlf for these files.
* text=auto eol=lf
vendor/youdu-cli/bin/* binary
